{"schema_version": "1.0", "status": "success", "source_page": 3, "page_id": "P000003", "source_image": "20-source/pages/P000003.jpg", "result": {"page_type": "text", "title": "", "columns": [{"order": 1, "text": "余素不谙地理事然憶在京師時每見親友家有條數年而無幾者了條數季而哀落者人莫不曰某家某地得也某家某地失也"}], "source_text": "余素不谙地理事然憶在京師時每見親友家有條數年而無幾者了條數季而哀落者人莫不曰某家某地得也某家某地失也", "nonbody_marks": ["雲南圖書館藏", "6740"], "uncertain_glyphs": [], "confidence": "high"}, "request": {"model": "Qwen/Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "elapsed_seconds": 16.531, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 5878, "completion_tokens": 186, "total_tokens": 6064}}, "generated_at": "2026-09-25T10:17:54.072193+00:00"}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "status": "success", "source_page": 4, "page_id": "P000004", "source_image": "20-source/pages/P000004.jpg", "result": {"page_type": "text", "title": "", "columns": [{"order": 1, "text": "而余搃未之知也及來佐"}, {"order": 2, "text": "理越郡山川秀色燦爛日"}, {"order": 3, "text": "中里巷大小戶莫不諱陰"}, {"order": 4, "text": "陽搜吉地余因是亦動念"}, {"order": 5, "text": "馬迨攝登陽事諸生中得"}, {"order": 6, "text": "一袁玉畫者素行孝友人"}], "source_text": "而余搃未之知也及來佐理越郡山川秀色燦爛日中里巷大小戶莫不諱陰陽搜吉地余因是亦動念馬迨攝登陽事諸生中得一袁玉畫者素行孝友人", "nonbody_marks": ["雪濤室圖書"], "uncertain_glyphs": [], "confidence": "high"}, "request": {"model": "Qwen/Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "elapsed_seconds": 30.962, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 5878, "completion_tokens": 290, "total_tokens": 6168}}, "generated_at": "2026-09-25T10:24:59.868811+00:00"}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "status": "success", "source_page": 5, "page_id": "P000005", "source_image": "20-source/pages/P000005.jpg", "result": {"page_type": "text", "title": "", "columns": [{"order": 1, "text": "也為嚴尊卜葬域延堪與"}, {"order": 2, "text": "家以求鶴舉而人各異詞"}, {"order": 3, "text": "理多淆雜吉凶無一定之"}, {"order": 4, "text": "見心甚撲似之庚辰春嚴"}, {"order": 5, "text": "陵張九儀以探親戾止諸"}, {"order": 6, "text": "登玉書素讀其四彈子砂"}], "source_text": "也為嚴尊卜葬域延堪與家以求鶴舉而人各異詞理多淆雜吉凶無一定之見心甚撲似之庚辰春嚴陵張九儀以探親戾止諸登玉書素讀其四彈子砂", "nonbody_marks": ["雪濤館集", "圖書館藏"], "uncertain_glyphs": [], "confidence": "high"}, "request": {"model": "Qwen/Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "elapsed_seconds": 29.218, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 5878, "completion_tokens": 294, "total_tokens": 6172}}, "generated_at": "2026-09-25T10:27:04.576355+00:00"}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "status": "success", "source_page": 6, "page_id": "P000006", "source_image": "20-source/pages/P000006.jpg", "result": {"page_type": "text", "title": "", "columns": [{"order": 1, "text": "求要诀两书每图会晤之"}, {"order": 2, "text": "妄由一旦责临相见不啻"}, {"order": 3, "text": "饥渴之得遇饮食也遂"}, {"order": 4, "text": "尽弟子礼执经而问难焉"}, {"order": 5, "text": "追随间覆视古仙迹其中"}, {"order": 6, "text": "贵贱贫富了了在目一如"}], "source_text": "求要诀两书每图会晤之妄由一旦责临相见不啻饥渴之得遇饮食也遂尽弟子礼执经而问难焉追随间覆视古仙迹其中贵贱贫富了了在目一如", "nonbody_marks": ["雪濤圖書"], "uncertain_glyphs": [], "confidence": "high"}, "request": {"model": "Qwen/Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "elapsed_seconds": 39.324, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 5878, "completion_tokens": 271, "total_tokens": 6149}}, "generated_at": "2026-09-25T10:28:12.412749+00:00"}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "status": "success", "source_page": 7, "page_id": "P000007", "source_image": "20-source/pages/P000007.jpg", "result": {"page_type": "text", "title": "", "columns": [{"order": 1, "text": "未澈者於人遂以為神奇"}, {"order": 2, "text": "詭怪不可以尋常測澈而"}, {"order": 3, "text": "不知其寔卒易淺近筐"}, {"order": 4, "text": "中所手錄者不過一琢玉"}, {"order": 5, "text": "斧蠻頭歌括而已夫琢玉"}, {"order": 6, "text": "斧初學入門之書而九儀"}], "source_text": "未澈者於人遂以為神奇詭怪不可以尋常測澈而不知其寔卒易淺近筐中所手錄者不過一琢玉斧蠻頭歌括而已夫琢玉斧初學入門之書而九儀", "nonbody_marks": ["雪濤圖書館藏印"], "uncertain_glyphs": [], "confidence": "high"}, "request": {"model": "Qwen/Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "elapsed_seconds": 27.572, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 5878, "completion_tokens": 280, "total_tokens": 6158}}, "generated_at": "2026-09-25T10:29:26.646933+00:00"}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "status": "success", "source_page": 8, "page_id": "P000008", "source_image": "20-source/pages/P000008.jpg", "result": {"page_type": "text", "title": "", "columns": [{"order": 1, "text": "增釋之誡之以已往舊地"}, {"order": 2, "text": "而發明之是知讀書者不"}, {"order": 3, "text": "主多而在精固非獨制舉"}, {"order": 4, "text": "家為然也經河洛之理挨"}, {"order": 5, "text": "星之法口授以傳者固有"}, {"order": 6, "text": "秘旨而取其理而布施之"}], "source_text": "增釋之誡之以已往舊地而發明之是知讀書者不主多而在精固非獨制舉家為然也經河洛之理挨星之法口授以傳者固有秘旨而取其理而布施之", "nonbody_marks": ["雪濤圖書館藏"], "uncertain_glyphs": [], "confidence": "high"}, "request": {"model": "Qwen/Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "elapsed_seconds": 18.334, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 5878, "completion_tokens": 289, "total_tokens": 6167}}, "generated_at": "2026-09-25T10:30:49.899008+00:00"}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "status": "success", "source_page": 9, "page_id": "P000009", "source_image": "20-source/pages/P000009.jpg", "result": {"page_type": "text", "title": "", "columns": [{"order": 1, "text": "實踐取其法而運用之罔"}, {"order": 2, "text": "織實不外此歌括中所論"}, {"order": 3, "text": "之密頸而余之素不讀地"}, {"order": 4, "text": "理者捧誦之批閱之亦不"}, {"order": 5, "text": "覺為之動念已"}, {"order": 6, "text": "肯"}], "source_text": "實踐取其法而運用之罔織實不外此歌括中所論之密頸而余之素不讀地理者捧誦之批閱之亦不覺為之動念已肯", "nonbody_marks": ["雪濤居士圖書"], "uncertain_glyphs": [], "confidence": "high"}, "request": {"model": "Qwen/Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct", "attempt": 1, "elapsed_seconds": 31.26, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 5878, "completion_tokens": 268, "total_tokens": 6146}}, "generated_at": "2026-09-25T10:32:18.747689+00:00"}
